      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/{size}/7330_2.png",
      "created_at": "2012-04-13T16:22:44.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>None of the above? I’ll generally choose based on who others choose. For example, if no one has chosen a “brute” character, I often will. If no one has chosen someone with removal capabilities (“support”), I’ll often take one of those. It also depends on my mood, as I might be more inclined to play a brute if I’ve had a bad day at work. <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/wink.png?v=9\" title=\":wink:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":wink:\"></p>\n<p>The closest you have is “based on who we like”, so that’s what I voted.  8)</p>",
